{#
    What the gift cards cover, and what the customer will actually be charged.

    Rendered into Sylius' shared order summary table, which is what the checkout summary page and
    the account order page both build on - and into the checkout sidebar that the addressing,
    shipping and payment steps show.

    Without it every one of those pages ends at "Order total", which under the tender model is the
    full price of the goods: a customer paying partly with a card would be told to expect a charge
    much larger than the one that reaches their card. See docs/adr-log/0010-gift-card-as-tender.md.
#}
{% import "@SyliusShop/shared/macro/money.html.twig" as money %}

{% set order = hookable_metadata.context.order %}
{% set gift_card_total = order.giftCardTotal is defined ? order.giftCardTotal : 0 %}

{% if gift_card_total > 0 %}
    <tr>
        <td>{{ 'madcoders_sylius_gift_card.ui.gift_cards'|trans }}:</td>
        <td class="text-end" {{ sylius_test_html_attribute('checkout-gift-card-total') }}>
            -{{ money.convertAndFormat(gift_card_total) }}
        </td>
    </tr>

    <tr>
        <td class="h5">{{ 'madcoders_sylius_gift_card.ui.amount_to_pay'|trans }}:</td>
        <td class="h5 text-end" {{ sylius_test_html_attribute('checkout-amount-to-pay') }}>
            {{ money.convertAndFormat(order.amountToPay) }}
        </td>
    </tr>
{% endif %}
